Third-party content

The skills this plugin browses and installs are NOT part of this project and are
NOT covered by its licence.

Each skill is created and published by its own author on SkillHub
(https://skillhub.cn). Copyright in every skill belongs to that author, and each
skill is governed by whatever licence its own SKILL.md declares. Installing a
skill downloads it from SkillHub at that moment; this project does not host,
mirror, relicense or resell any skill content.

What this project does handle is index metadata retrieved from SkillHub's public
API — names, descriptions, versions, download and save counts, category, the
third-party security-scan verdicts, and file listings — together with individual
file text fetched on request for the preview shown before you install. That
metadata is used only to display and identify the skills, and links back to the
original pages on SkillHub.

